<translation id="1392131731909663319">Ili upate masasisho yajayo ya Phromium, utahitaji kutumia toleo la Windows 10 au toleo jipya zaidi. Kompyuta hii inatumia toleo la Windows 7.</translation>
<translation id="4512427777724578739">Ungependa kufungua Phromium tena?</translation>
<translation id="4510527847350985067">Haiwezi kusakinisha toleo sawia la Phromium ambalo linaendeshwa hivi sasa. Tafadhali funga Phromium na ujaribu tena.</translation>
